'''Pterowl Hazuku''' (超竜獣オウルハズク, ''Chō Ryūjū Ōruhazuku'', '''Super Dragon-Beast Owlhazuku''') is a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]]/[[:Category:Behemoth Enemies|Behemoth]] variant of [[Owlbrow]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 11.5 Update|Version 11.5]].

