==Trivia==
*"Pterowl" is a portmanteau of ''ptero-'' (wing) or ''pterosaur'' (a type of flying reptile from the Mesozoic Era that lived alongside dinosaurs) and ''owl''.
*The name Hazuku is derived from コノハズク ''Konohazuku'' (the Japanese name of the largest genus of owls, [[wikipedia:Scops owl|''Otus'']]).
*Pterowl Hazuku makes a few possible ''Monster Hunter'' references.
**Hazuku's Japanese name (オウルハズク ''Ōruhazuku'', "Owlhazuku") is somewhat similar to the Japanese name of [[wikia:monsterhunter:Vaal Hazak|Vaal Hazak]] (ヴァルハザク ''Varuhazaku'', "Valhazak" or "Valhazaku").
**It has a similar color scheme to [[wikia:monsterhunter:Silver Rathalos|Silver Rathalos]], flies a lot, and attacks by spitting a blue fireball born from anger, which Silver Rathalos is also known to do when enraged.
**As a monstrous owl with draconic wings, it may also represent [[wikia:monsterhunter:Malfestio|Malfestio]].
*[[Ensanglion the Calamity]]'s Japanese description refers to him as an ancient/elder dragon (古龍 ''koryū''), while Pterowl Hazuku's Japanese title (超竜獣 ''Chō Ryūjū'') translates to "Super Dragon-Beast", but they use different kanji for "dragon": Ensanglion's is 龍, whereas Hazuku's is 竜. In ''Monster Hunter'' terms, Ensanglion is an [[wikia:Elder Dragon|Elder Dragon]] (古龍種 ''Koryūshu''), but Hazuku is only a [[wikia:monsterhunter:Flying Wyvern|Flying Wyvern]] (飛竜種 ''Hiryūshu'') or [[wikia:monsterhunter:Bird Wyvern|Bird Wyvern]] (鳥竜種 ''Chōryūshu'').
*[[Owlbrow]] is stated to be 78 years old, while Pterowl Hazuku is 79.
**It can be inferred that Hazuku's "years of pent-up anger" are from constantly being treated as a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy despite only walking.

